		c	Handles the attack damage inflicted by entities. The value of this attribute represents half hearts.
	f	Lbhb;	g	field_23722	ATTACK_KNOCKBACK
		c	Handles additional horizontal knockback when damaging another entity.
	f	Lbhb;	h	field_23723	ATTACK_SPEED
		c	Handles the cooldown rate when attacking with an item. The value represents the number of full strength attacks that can be performed per second.
	f	Lbhb;	i	field_23724	ARMOR
		c	Handles the armor points for an entity. Each point represents half a chestplate of armor on the armor bar.
	f	Lbhb;	j	field_23725	ARMOR_TOUGHNESS
