c	dec	net/minecraft/class_2806	net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/ChunkStatus
	c	The statuses that chunks go through during different phases of generation and loading.\nEach status has an asynchronous task that is completed to generate a chunk, and one to load a chunk up to that status.\nChunks are generated in sequential stages, some of which rely on nearby chunks from the previous stage. To this respect, tasks define a "range" that they require chunks to be generated up to the previous stage. This is responsible for the concentric squares seen in the chunk loading screen.
